<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amalgamated buys Sydney wildlife park.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amalgamated buys Sydney wildlife park.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amalgamated Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that it had acquired the Featherdale Wildlife Park in western Sydney for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The company said the park would form part of its tourism and leisure division, which includes the recently acquired Matilda Cruises operation which conducts tours of Sydney Harbour.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to comment on the acquisition price.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
